{"id":"755e421576224435","group":"20","path":"20/20-df-strings.md","title":"有限串、前缀与拼接","display":"df-strings — 有限串、前缀与拼接","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-df-strings","aliases":["20-df-strings"],"display":"df-strings — 有限串、前缀与拼接","chapter":"3","section":"3.7","source_kind":"book","verification_status":"reviewed","source_reference":"Definition 3.7.1；Notation: Strings","source_pdf_pages":[107],"source_printed_pages":[71],"depends_on":["[[20-df-pairing]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-df-strings"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-df-strings</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-strings — 有限串、前缀与拼接"},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.7"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"reviewed"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.7.1；Notation: Strings"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>107</span></div>"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>71</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\{2,\\omega\\}\">\\(D\\in\\{2,\\omega\\}\\)</span>，其中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2=\\{0,1\\}\">\\(2=\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\)</span> 为有限序列，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in D^\\omega\">\\(X\\in D^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"35073b74f84433b3\" href=\"?note=35073b74f84433b3\" title=\"20-df-pairing\">20-df-pairing</a>。</p>\n<p>有限序列的定义域是有限序数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma,\\tau\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\sigma,\\tau\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\omega\">\\(n\\in\\omega\\)</span>。单字符序列 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(i)\">\\((i)\\)</span> 由 Assertion 定义。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i,j\\in\\omega\">\\(i,j\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in D\">\\(b\\in D\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho,\\eta\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\\cup D^\\omega\">\\(\\rho,\\eta\\in D^{&lt;\\omega}\\cup D^\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strings}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD^{&lt;\\omega}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D^n,\\quad |\\sigma|:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma),\\\\\n\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ |\\sigma|\\le|\\tau|\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\sigma|\\ [\\sigma(i)=\\tau(i)],\\\\\n\\sigma\\prec\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\land|\\sigma|&lt;|\\tau|,\\quad\n\\sigma\\preceq X\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall i&lt;|\\sigma|\\ [\\sigma(i)=X(i)],\\\\\n(\\sigma^\\frown\\tau)(i):=\\begin{cases}\\sigma(i)&amp;i&lt;|\\sigma|,\\\\\\tau(i-|\\sigma|)&amp;|\\sigma|\\le i&lt;|\\sigma|+|\\tau|,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\sigma\\perp\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\lor\\tau\\preceq\\sigma).\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strings}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD^{&lt;\\omega}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D^n,\\quad |\\sigma|:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma),\\\\\n\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ |\\sigma|\\le|\\tau|\\land\\forall i&lt;|\\sigma|\\ [\\sigma(i)=\\tau(i)],\\\\\n\\sigma\\prec\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\land|\\sigma|&lt;|\\tau|,\\quad\n\\sigma\\preceq X\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall i&lt;|\\sigma|\\ [\\sigma(i)=X(i)],\\\\\n(\\sigma^\\frown\\tau)(i):=\\begin{cases}\\sigma(i)&amp;i&lt;|\\sigma|,\\\\\\tau(i-|\\sigma|)&amp;|\\sigma|\\le i&lt;|\\sigma|+|\\tau|,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\sigma\\perp\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\lor\\tau\\preceq\\sigma).\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{code}:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\omega,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma):=2^{|\\sigma|}-1+\\sum_{i&lt;|\\sigma|}\\sigma(i)2^i,\\\\\n\\sigma_n:=\\bigcup\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)=n\\},\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists!\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)=n],\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma^\\frown\\tau):=|\\sigma|+|\\tau|,\\qquad\n\\sigma^\\frown i:=\\sigma^\\frown(i)\\quad(i\\in D),\\\\\n\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\tau,\\qquad\n\\sigma\\parallel\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\lor\\tau\\preceq\\sigma.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{code}:2^{&lt;\\omega}\\to\\omega,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma):=2^{|\\sigma|}-1+\\sum_{i&lt;|\\sigma|}\\sigma(i)2^i,\\\\\n\\sigma_n:=\\bigcup\\{\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}:\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)=n\\},\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists!\\sigma\\in2^{&lt;\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)=n],\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma^\\frown\\tau):=|\\sigma|+|\\tau|,\\qquad\n\\sigma^\\frown i:=\\sigma^\\frown(i)\\quad(i\\in D),\\\\\n\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\tau,\\qquad\n\\sigma\\parallel\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\lor\\tau\\preceq\\sigma.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{gathered}\n(b):=\\{(0,b)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma^\\frown X):=\\omega,\\qquad\n(\\sigma^\\frown X)(n):=\\begin{cases}\\sigma(n)&amp;n&lt;|\\sigma|,\\\\X(n-|\\sigma|)&amp;|\\sigma|\\le n,\\end{cases}\\\\\nX\\succeq\\sigma\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq X,\\qquad\n\\sigma\\prec X\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq X,\\\\\n\\operatorname{rep}(b,n):=\\{(j,b):j&lt;n\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{rep}(b,\\omega):=\\{(j,b):j\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\rho&lt;_{lex}\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho)\\subsetneq\\operatorname{dom}(\\eta)\\land\\rho\\subseteq\\eta\\bigr)\n\\lor\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\eta)\\\n\\bigl[(\\forall i&lt;j\\ \\rho(i)=\\eta(i))\\land\\rho(j)&lt;\\eta(j)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\rho\\le_{lex}\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\rho=\\eta\\lor\\rho&lt;_{lex}\\eta.\n\\end{gathered}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{gathered}\n(b):=\\{(0,b)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma^\\frown X):=\\omega,\\qquad\n(\\sigma^\\frown X)(n):=\\begin{cases}\\sigma(n)&amp;n&lt;|\\sigma|,\\\\X(n-|\\sigma|)&amp;|\\sigma|\\le n,\\end{cases}\\\\\nX\\succeq\\sigma\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq X,\\qquad\n\\sigma\\prec X\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq X,\\\\\n\\operatorname{rep}(b,n):=\\{(j,b):j&lt;n\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{rep}(b,\\omega):=\\{(j,b):j\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\rho&lt;_{lex}\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho)\\subsetneq\\operatorname{dom}(\\eta)\\land\\rho\\subseteq\\eta\\bigr)\n\\lor\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\eta)\\\n\\bigl[(\\forall i&lt;j\\ \\rho(i)=\\eta(i))\\land\\rho(j)&lt;\\eta(j)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\rho\\le_{lex}\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\rho=\\eta\\lor\\rho&lt;_{lex}\\eta.\n\\end{gathered}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>这里有限序列的定义域是一个有限序数，因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\sigma|\">\\(|\\sigma|\\)</span> 是自然数。对二进制串采用编码 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)=2^{|\\sigma|}-1+\\sum_{i&lt;|\\sigma|}\\sigma(i)2^i\">\\(\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)=2^{|\\sigma|}-1+\\sum_{i&lt;|\\sigma|}\\sigma(i)2^i\\)</span>，可有效恢复长度和各位；空串编码为 0。自然数串用长度及有限元组编码。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.7.1；Notation: Strings；印刷页 71；PDF 第 107 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-pairing]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-pairing","status":"resolved","id":"35073b74f84433b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-pairing]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"D\\in\\{2,\\omega\\}","display":false},{"tex":"2=\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"X\\in D^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\sigma,\\tau\\in D^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"(i)","display":false},{"tex":"i,j\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in D","display":false},{"tex":"\\rho,\\eta\\in D^{<\\omega}\\cup D^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}strings}\\vdash\n\\begin{gathered}\nD^{<\\omega}:=\\bigcup_{n\\in\\omega}D^n,\\quad |\\sigma|:=\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma),\\\\\n\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ |\\sigma|\\le|\\tau|\\land\\forall i<|\\sigma|\\ [\\sigma(i)=\\tau(i)],\\\\\n\\sigma\\prec\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\land|\\sigma|<|\\tau|,\\quad\n\\sigma\\preceq X\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\forall i<|\\sigma|\\ [\\sigma(i)=X(i)],\\\\\n(\\sigma^\\frown\\tau)(i):=\\begin{cases}\\sigma(i)&i<|\\sigma|,\\\\\\tau(i-|\\sigma|)&|\\sigma|\\le i<|\\sigma|+|\\tau|,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\sigma\\perp\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\neg(\\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\lor\\tau\\preceq\\sigma).\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n\\operatorname{code}:2^{<\\omega}\\to\\omega,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma):=2^{|\\sigma|}-1+\\sum_{i<|\\sigma|}\\sigma(i)2^i,\\\\\n\\sigma_n:=\\bigcup\\{\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}:\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)=n\\},\\qquad\n\\forall n\\in\\omega\\ \\exists!\\sigma\\in2^{<\\omega}\\ [\\operatorname{code}(\\sigma)=n],\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma^\\frown\\tau):=|\\sigma|+|\\tau|,\\qquad\n\\sigma^\\frown i:=\\sigma^\\frown(i)\\quad(i\\in D),\\\\\n\\tau\\succeq\\sigma\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\tau,\\qquad\n\\sigma\\parallel\\tau\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq\\tau\\lor\\tau\\preceq\\sigma.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{gathered}\n(b):=\\{(0,b)\\},\\\\\n\\operatorname{dom}(\\sigma^\\frown X):=\\omega,\\qquad\n(\\sigma^\\frown X)(n):=\\begin{cases}\\sigma(n)&n<|\\sigma|,\\\\X(n-|\\sigma|)&|\\sigma|\\le n,\\end{cases}\\\\\nX\\succeq\\sigma\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq X,\\qquad\n\\sigma\\prec X\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\sigma\\preceq X,\\\\\n\\operatorname{rep}(b,n):=\\{(j,b):j<n\\},\\qquad\n\\operatorname{rep}(b,\\omega):=\\{(j,b):j\\in\\omega\\},\\\\\n\\rho<_{lex}\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\bigl(\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho)\\subsetneq\\operatorname{dom}(\\eta)\\land\\rho\\subseteq\\eta\\bigr)\n\\lor\\exists j\\in\\operatorname{dom}(\\rho)\\cap\\operatorname{dom}(\\eta)\\\n\\bigl[(\\forall i<j\\ \\rho(i)=\\eta(i))\\land\\rho(j)<\\eta(j)\\bigr],\\\\\n\\rho\\le_{lex}\\eta\\ :\\Longleftrightarrow\\ \\rho=\\eta\\lor\\rho<_{lex}\\eta.\n\\end{gathered}","display":true},{"tex":"|\\sigma|","display":false},{"tex":"\\operato